WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.031
One missing paper. Several possible boundaries.

00:00:36.031 --> 00:01:13.317
First establish whether the paper could have been returned

00:01:13.317 --> 00:01:50.353
Absent from the pool and hidden after it need different checks

00:01:50.353 --> 00:02:22.578
The indexed evidence may differ from the visible excerpt

00:02:22.578 --> 00:03:04.784
Four lenses ask different kinds of question

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:46.809
Different words can express a sufficiently related concept

00:03:46.809 --> 00:04:27.863
BM25 and dense retrieval offer different bridges

00:04:27.863 --> 00:05:07.567
A result screen supplies symptoms, not causes
